  "content": {
    "title": "When does 'The Reunion: Laguna Beach' come out? How to watch.",
    "text": "April 9, 2026, 3:00 p.m. ETGet ready to blast \"Come Clean\" by Hilary Duff.The original cast of the early-2000s era \"Laguna Beach: The Real Orange County\" is reuniting to honor the 20th anniversary of the iconic reality series that took over pop culture for millennials. Fans will be able to dive into the special this Friday, April 10.The teen show was on MTV and aired from 2004 to 2006 for three seasons.\"The beloved cast will celebrate the nostalgia, friendships, and coastal backdrop that continues to captivate audiences to this day,\" Roku said in a news release.Here's how to watch \"The Reunion: Laguna Beach.\"When does 'The Reunion: Laguna Beach' premiere?\"The Reunion: Laguna Beach\" premieres on Friday, April 10, at midnight local time on The Roku Channel. It will be available for free on the streaming service.The two-hour special \"will feature untold behind-the-scenes stories, cast reactions to episodes of the original series, and a present-day return to where it all started,\" Roku stated.'The Reunion: Laguna Beach' TrailerCastLauren ConradKristin CavallariStephen CollettiTrey PhillipsTalan TorrieroChristina SchullerLo BosworthDieter SchmitzJessica SmithAlex HooserMorgan SmithLauren Conrad says she prefers living out of the limelightIn an interview on her former co-star's podcast \"Let's Be Honest with Kristin Cavallari,\" Lauren Conrad spoke about why she decided to participate in the reunion and moving on from reality television, admitting that she prefers \"a quieter life.\"\"I'm at a point where I don't really do anything anymore, and I would love to put a pin in my career on television,\" she said. \"I was like it would be really cool to end my career with the same people I started it with.\"\"The same group of people I started with, I can also say goodbye with,\" she continued. \"It felt clean.\"Taylor Ardrey is a news reporter for USA TODAY. You can reach her at tardrey@usatodayco.com.",
